  "open_questions_for_founder": [
    "AI-identified segments: this file seeds layer 2/3 from the 22 ratified domains and observed Austin supply. It is explicitly NOT complete — the discovery sweep is expected to surface sub-subsegments nobody typed, and those land here as proposals, never auto-adopted.",
    "PER (person) entities have no home today: the catalog holds exactly 1 artist across 180 rows. An artist registry is a schema decision, not a taxonomy one.",
    "Whether this file stays JSON (disk-is-truth, reviewable in a diff) or becomes a Postgres table (joinable, RLS-governed). JSON first is reversible; a migration is not."
